*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Phomemo T02 - macOS BLE bridge. macOS renders the page, t02bridge (LaunchAgent)
*% converts it and sends it over Bluetooth. Raster goes to socket://127.0.0.1:9100.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "PHOMT02.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Phomemo"
*Product: "(T02)"
*ModelName: "Phomemo T02"
*ShortNickName: "Phomemo T02"
*NickName: "Phomemo T02 (BLE bridge)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*% "-" = pass-through: CUPS stops at raster and ships it to the backend untouched.
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 -"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Receipt48
*PageSize w48h30/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h40/48 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h50/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h75/48 x 75 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 212.60]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h100/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h150/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 425.20]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w48h200/48 x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 566.93]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Receipt48/Ticket 48 mm (coupe auto): "<</PageSize[136.2 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Receipt48
*PageRegion w48h30/48 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h40/48 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h50/48 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h75/48 x 75 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 212.60]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h100/48 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 283.46]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h150/48 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 425.20]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w48h200/48 x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136.2 566.93]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Receipt48/Ticket 48 mm (coupe auto): "<</PageSize[136.2 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Receipt48
*ImageableArea w48h30/48 x 30 mm: "0 0 136.2 85.04"
*ImageableArea w48h40/48 x 40 mm: "0 0 136.2 113.39"
*ImageableArea w48h50/48 x 50 mm: "0 0 136.2 141.73"
*ImageableArea w48h75/48 x 75 mm: "0 0 136.2 212.60"
*ImageableArea w48h100/48 x 100 mm: "0 0 136.2 283.46"
*ImageableArea w48h150/48 x 150 mm: "0 0 136.2 425.20"
*ImageableArea w48h200/48 x 200 mm: "0 0 136.2 566.93"
*ImageableArea Receipt48/Ticket 48 mm (coupe auto): "0 0 136.2 841.89"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Receipt48
*PaperDimension w48h30/48 x 30 mm: "136.2 85.04"
*PaperDimension w48h40/48 x 40 mm: "136.2 113.39"
*PaperDimension w48h50/48 x 50 mm: "136.2 141.73"
*PaperDimension w48h75/48 x 75 mm: "136.2 212.60"
*PaperDimension w48h100/48 x 100 mm: "136.2 283.46"
*PaperDimension w48h150/48 x 150 mm: "136.2 425.20"
*PaperDimension w48h200/48 x 200 mm: "136.2 566.93"
*PaperDimension Receipt48/Ticket 48 mm (coupe auto): "136.2 841.89"

*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "136.2"
*MaxMediaHeight: "14400"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 36 136.2
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 36 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% Job options travel in the raster header (cupsInteger0-3) - see t02bridge/pipeline.py
*OpenUI *Density/Densité: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: Normal
*Density Light/Clair: "<</cupsInteger0 1>>setpagedevice"
*Density Normal/Normal: "<</cupsInteger0 2>>setpagedevice"
*Density Dark/Foncé: "<</cupsInteger0 3>>setpagedevice"
*Density Darkest/Très foncé: "<</cupsInteger0 4>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Density

*OpenUI *Dither/Tramage: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Dither
*DefaultDither: Auto
*Dither Auto/Auto (texte net, photo tramée): "<</cupsInteger1 0>>setpagedevice"
*Dither Floyd/Photo - Floyd-Steinberg: "<</cupsInteger1 1>>setpagedevice"
*Dither Threshold/Texte - seuil net: "<</cupsInteger1 2>>setpagedevice"
*Dither Atkinson/Photo - Atkinson: "<</cupsInteger1 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Dither

*OpenUI *FeedAfter/Avance papier en fin de job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *FeedAfter
*DefaultFeedAfter: None
*FeedAfter None/Aucune: "<</cupsInteger2 0>>setpagedevice"
*FeedAfter Feed5/+5 mm: "<</cupsInteger2 40>>setpagedevice"
*FeedAfter Feed10/+10 mm: "<</cupsInteger2 80>>setpagedevice"
*FeedAfter Feed15/+15 mm: "<</cupsInteger2 120>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *FeedAfter

*OpenUI *TrimBlank/Couper le blanc en bas: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *TrimBlank
*DefaultTrimBlank: True
*TrimBlank True/Oui (économise le papier): "<</cupsInteger3 1>>setpagedevice"
*TrimBlank False/Non (taille exacte): "<</cupsInteger3 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *TrimBlank

